     1156   define temp-table tt-temp no-undo
     1157   field gds-code   as integer
     1158   field price-rubl  as decimal
     1159   field price-cli   as decimal
     1160   field fact-date   as date
     1161      FIELD Num         as INTEGER
     1162      index pi
     1163            gds-code
     1164            fact-date
     1165            price-rubl
